{
  "app_id": 4284570,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Enjoy managing your shop and the endless fun of unboxing! BLIND BOX SHOP SIMULATOR is a fun mix of blind box collecting and shop management. Build your store, collect rare items, and enjoy the satisfaction of growing your business while feeding your collecting obsession Collect a variety of blind box products, each offering surprises like rare or limited-edition items. Experience the full joy of unboxing—shake the box, tear open the packaging, and watch the character debut. Design themed exhibition zones to display your premium collections. Use decorations and displays to create immersive areas that attract customers and boost your shop's appeal. Recruit popular streamers to unbox products live, increasing your shop’s visibility and attracting more customers. Use 3D printing to create collectible statues from popular blind box items, offering unique products for your customers. Bring your collection to life with a holographic display cabinet. Interact with NPCs to trade blind boxes and fulfill your obsession with rare or hidden edition items. Exchange with NPCs to obtain unique products and further expand your collection. Personalize your shop’s layout and design to create a unique shopping environment that attracts more customers and boosts sales. Earn profits to reinvest in your shop. Expand your space, unlock new blind box sets, and upgrad the statue display area to attract more customers and boost revenue. If you love simulation games, collecting, and trendy toys, Blind Box Shop Simulator offers a perfect experience for you!"
  },
